{"type":"frame-snapshot","snapshot":{"callId":"qmmb@611","phase":"after","pageId":"page@6689e86995e2efbc826aec6fafa945c4","frameId":"frame@4ae941a7eaa284505a53758fc6a06bfe","frameUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:4206/?devtools=1&legacyopening=1","doctype":"html","html":["HTML",{"lang":"en","style":"--visual-height: 900px;"},[[95,53]],[[95,54]],["BODY",{},[[95,55]],["DIV",{"id":"root"},["DIV",{"class":"app-root theme-light"},["DIV",{"class":"device surface-app"},[[18,2]],["DIV",{"class":"phone-content"},["SECTION",{"class":"opening-screen","aria-label":"Sophie Mercer first contact"},["HEADER",{"class":"opening-chat-header"},["BUTTON",{"class":"icon-button bare","aria-label":"Back"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"20","height":"20","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5"}]]],["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar opening-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]],["DIV",{},["STRONG",{},"Sophie Mercer"],["SMALL",{},"Unknown number · identity unverified"]],["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"20","height":"20","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-message-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"opening-thread"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-timestamp"},"Thursday 8 October · 08:41"],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Hi. I'm sorry for messaging out of nowhere."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Sorry. I know you don't know me. Is this a bad time?"],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"My name is Sophie Mercer."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"My brother Daniel gave me this number before he disappeared."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He said if anything happened to him, I should contact you."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He hasn't come home in three days."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Who is Daniel Mercer?"],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"My older brother. He worked with old civic records."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"There is a small chat with people close to Daniel. I could add you, if you're comfortable. They don't know why he left your number either."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"You can add me. I will listen first."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I'm sorry about the group. I thought it would help to explain why Daniel gave me your number."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I didn't tell them everything he left me. He made me keep a page. I can send you a photo, if you still want to see it."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Send it. I will look, but I cannot promise what it means."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"That's fair. I don't know what it means either."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He left me a handwritten note. I'll send you a photo. Please read it."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"I'll see what I can find."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Thank you. Please be careful. I don't know who else has this number."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I don't want to make this your problem. But I don't know why he chose you, and I can't ignore that."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"When did you last see him?"],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Three days ago. We argued about something stupid before he left."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Does any of it mean something to you?"],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Wait. A message just came through asking about a recovery request. Did you do that?"],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"No. I haven't requested anything."],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Then who did?"],["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie","role":"status","aria-label":"Sophie is typing"},"..."]],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-jump"},"Jump to latest"],["DIV",{"class":"opening-actions"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-action-heading"},"Sophie is typing..."]]]],[[78,25]]]]],[[95,59]],[[95,60]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":900},"timestamp":2164429.762,"wallTime":1792825205008,"collectionTime":0.7999999523162842,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
